5,1,1,talk,Shizue,,I worry about who is actually left to do the work. The staff list has changed so much.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Shion,,I want to know where past seasons failed. We keep apologising at the door for delays.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,May,,I am curious about what visitors actually remember. The shows we loved on paper didn't bring them back.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Misaki,,I need to know if the building can handle the weight. The floor and diary are already strained.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Sakura,,I am worried about the money! It always seems to vanish into the walls. I want to see the invoices.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Sakura, the money is important, but without hands, the work stops. I will look at the volunteer roster.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Shion,,"@Misaki, the building is a risk, but the paperwork is the real trap. I will check the lender paperwork.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,May,,"@Shion, delays are bad, but empty rooms are worse. I will look at the weekend head counts.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Misaki,,"@Shion, I agree. I will also check the structural survey to see what the bay can hold.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Sakura,,"@Shizue, I will check the loan transport costs and the mount-making charges. I want to see where the cash goes!","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Shizue,,I will also review the conservation lab staffing. We need to know who is cleaning the objects.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Shion,,I will also look at the maintenance log for powered displays. They seem to break often.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,May,,I will also read the five years of visitor comment slips. I want to hear their voices.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Misaki,,I will also check the evening hire bookings. The gallery is used for other things too.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Sakura,,I am excited to see the numbers! Let's find out where the budget really goes.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Shizue,,Let us trust the data. It will tell us who is truly available.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Shion,,Agreed. The data will show us the real bottlenecks.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,May,,"I hope the comments are honest. They always are, in the end.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Misaki,,The building will tell us the truth. It never lies.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Sakura,,I can't wait to see the invoices! Let's get to work.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
