35,2,1,talk,Shizue,,The volunteer roster is mostly the town history circle. They are busy with walks. The lab has only one person.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Shion,,Two openings slipped because paperwork arrived late. The powered displays had seventeen call-outs last season.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,May,,Head counts drop in rooms with only cased objects. Visitors say they come back because someone was present.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Misaki,,"The bay holds four hundred kilos. Last time, stonework needed shoring. Evenings are hired out six times a season.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Sakura,,Transport costs are a third of installation! Mount-making is expensive per object. Anything self-supported is free.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Sakura, if transport is so high, we must avoid heavy loans. The lab is also overwhelmed.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Shion,,"@Misaki, the structural limit is tight. We cannot risk shoring again. The paperwork delays are a real threat.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,May,,"@Shion, if people come for presence, we need live elements. But the powered displays break too often.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Misaki,,"@Shion, I agree. The bay is weak. We need something light that doesn't need constant repair.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Sakura,,"@Shizue, I agree! Self-supported items save money. We should pick something that doesn't need expensive mounts.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Shizue,,"@May, presence is key. But who will be present? The lab is empty. The volunteers are busy.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Shion,,"@May, presence is good, but if the displays break, it's a disaster. We need reliability.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,May,,"@Shizue, I hear you. We need a show that works with the staff we have, not the one we wish for.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Misaki,,"@Shion, reliability is vital. The evening hires also damage open arrangements. We need something secure.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Sakura,,"@Misaki, secure is good! I want to save money and keep the building safe. Let's find a balance.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Shizue,,We must choose wisely. The staff is stretched thin. We need a show that respects their limits.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Shion,,Agreed. The data shows the risks. We must avoid the traps of the past.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,May,,I agree. The visitors want connection. We must provide it without breaking the budget or the building.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Misaki,,The building is the foundation. We must protect it.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Sakura,,I am ready to vote! Let's pick the best option for everyone.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
