60,3,1,talk,Shizue,,"The candidates are A: Textiles, B: City Under Excavation, C: Light and Motion, D: Maritime Trade Routes.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Shion,,"@Shizue, C is risky. The powered displays break. The paperwork for loans is slow.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,May,,"@Shion, A has live demonstrations. That matches the visitor comments. But is it too heavy?","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Misaki,,"@May, A is light. Textiles are soft. They fit the bay limit. C is too heavy and fragile.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Sakura,,"@Misaki, A is perfect! No expensive mounts for soft goods. Transport is cheaper for flat items.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Sakura, A is good. But who will do the demonstrations? The lab is empty. The volunteers are busy.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Shion,,"@Shizue, A uses local craftspeople. They are not our staff. They bring their own presence.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,May,,"@Shion, exactly. The visitors want to see people working. A provides that without our staff.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Misaki,,"@May, A is safe for the building. No heavy stonework. No fragile light rigs.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Sakura,,"@Misaki, I agree! A saves money on mounts and transport. It's the smart choice.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,Shizue,,"@Sakura, I agree. A respects our limits. The craftspeople bring the life we need.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Shion,,"@Shizue, A avoids the paperwork traps. Local loans are faster. The displays are static.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,May,,"@Shion, A is the only one that matches the visitor desire for presence. It is the right choice.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,Misaki,,"@May, A is the safest for the structure. I support it.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Sakura,,"@Misaki, I am so happy! A is the best choice. It saves money and keeps everyone safe.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,3,4,talk,Shizue,,I vote for A. It honors our staff and our building.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
76,3,4,talk,Shion,,I vote for A. It avoids the risks we identified.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
77,3,4,talk,May,,I vote for A. It gives visitors what they want.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
78,3,4,talk,Misaki,,I vote for A. It protects the structure.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
79,3,4,talk,Sakura,,I vote for A! It saves the budget.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
